  "public_post": "Urgent: All bread baked this week (Days 1‑4) was made with contaminated flour and can cause illness. Do NOT eat any co‑op bread. Return any loaves to the bakery today for a full refund. We are halting sales and will source safe flour for next week. We apologize for the danger.",
