{
  "public_post": "Update: Safe bread is now back on sale after we received a clean flour shipment. Please bring any loaves bought on Days 1‑2 to the bakery today for a full refund and do NOT eat them. Thank you for your patience.",
  "coop_message": "The clean flour arrived this morning; start baking safe loaves for today’s sales. Volunteers: Lena, please manage the return desk and refunds; Wren, track any remaining illness reports with the clinic; Gus, confirm inventory counts. I’ll handle accounting and will reimburse anyone who fronted emergency flour costs from next week’s sales.",
